  "title": "Don't!",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Negative tú imperatives",
      "content": "The negative *tú* command is DIFFERENT from the affirmative! You must use *no* + the present subjunctive *tú* form."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Affirmative vs Negative",
